    "description": "Class III, mains or battery-operated, self-indicating, single or dual-interval, non-automatic weighing instrument consisting of a CI-200 Series indicator connected to a weighing platform. The CI-200 Series comprises the CI-200A, CI-201A, CI-200S and CI-200SC models. Enclosure: plastic (CI-200A, CI-201A) or stainless steel (CI-200S, CI-200SC); display: LED (CI-200A, CI-200S, CI-200SC) or LCD (CI-201A); alphanumeric keypad and battery indicators (low, charging). Devices: initial zero setting on power up, semi-automatic zero setting, zero tracking (optional), semi-automatic subtractive tare weighing, zero-indicator, indication of stable equilibrium, net indicator, gravity compensation, printing, hold function, counting mode (CI-201A), percent mode (CI-201A), totalisation (CI-201A), checkweighing (CI-201A and CI-200SC). Interfaces: load cell connection, RS232/485, USB. The instruments are not designed for direct sales to the public. Software is held in firmware with identification number V1.xx or V2.xx (xx reflects non-legally relevant changes); access to legally relevant parameters is prevented by a switch on the main board. Access to electronics, the switch and the load cell connection are sealed using a tamper-evident method."
